UserController.java, lines 44-58:
  @GetMapping('/users/{id}')
  public ResponseEntity<User> getUser(@PathVariable Long id) {
      User user = userService.getUserById(id);
      return ResponseEntity.ok(user);
  }

Fix: Add null check in UserController.java:

  User user = userService.getUserById(id);
  if (user == null) {
      return ResponseEntity.notFound().build();
  }
  return ResponseEntity.ok(user);

This prevents the NullPointerException by returning a 404 response when the user is not found.
